~ fire
Somebody laid this fire, and not long ago. It burns slow and clean, the way a fire does when it has been fed all night.
=> END

~ wall
The back wall is worked, not natural. There are marks on it, low down, that you keep almost making out.
=> END

~ stones
A ring of stones, set too neatly. Someone sat here a long time, waiting for something to be over.
=> END
